  "measurement_provenance": "Storage/TLS/TCP probes ran sequentially while the renderer and compilers were stopped. Their exact executable and 134 compiled-input hashes are separately preserved. Later construction admission, quick-gather, isolated-test, layout, rental-chooser and plot-draping changes are covered by the final gates/native confirmation, not silently represented by those earlier measured binaries.",
  "scope": "Bounded correctness, real localhost TCP/TLS, SQLite recovery and Linux/X11 native interaction with Mesa software Vulkan. No complete Motor Town parity, AAA assets/physics, gaming-GPU performance, public-account hosting, distributed authority or MMORPG concurrent-player capacity claim."
